01:59:25.658 --> 01:59:43.759
» Now let's start everything from zero
Now let's start everything from zero )

01:59:43.967 --> 01:59:52.726
> Now let's start everything from zero 0

01:59:53.060 --> 02:00:00.567
D Let's start everything )

02:00:02.319 --> 02:00:04.446
"Black Knights," eh?

02:00:04.655 --> 02:00:11.078
Yeah. Britannia's rule will crumble at
the hands of Black Knights led by Zero.

02:00:12.121 --> 02:00:14.915
| question a resistance group
calling themselves "knights."

02:00:15.124 --> 02:00:20.713
You had me worried when you
slaughtered all the J.L.F. survivors.

02:00:20.921 --> 02:00:22.256
"Slaughtered"?

02:00:23.340 --> 02:00:24.925
You make it sound so evil.

02:00:25.134 --> 02:00:28.804
| merely got rid of some people planning
to defect to the Indian military district.

02:00:29.012 --> 02:00:31.765
While just happening to
involve the Britannian navy?

02:00:31.974 --> 02:00:34.560
Every tool has its use.

02:00:34.768 --> 02:00:38.021
You seem to be crushing plenty of
other resistance groups as well.

02:00:38.230 --> 02:00:40.357
The Black Knights' goal is justice.

02:00:40.566 --> 02:00:43.652
The pursuit of justice doesn't discriminate
between Britannian and resistance.

02:00:44.778 --> 02:00:47.823
I'll add any useful players
to my team, of course.

02:00:48.031 --> 02:00:49.241
With the Geass, if necessary.

02:00:49.450 --> 02:00:53.871
Your Geass power of absolute
obedience twists people's wills.

02:00:54.079 --> 02:00:55.330
There are bound to be times

02:00:55.539 --> 02:00:58.208
when you make someone lose their
beliefs or their purposes in life.

02:00:58.417 --> 02:01:00.461
--Do you--
--Yes, I realize that.

02:01:00.669 --> 02:01:06.216
But creating a world where Nunnally can live
happily takes priority over everything.

02:01:06.425 --> 02:01:08.802
I'm satisfied with being its shadow architect.

02:01:09.011 --> 02:01:13.182
Shadow? Then what about the people in
the sunshine? What about the outdoors?

02:01:16.560 --> 02:01:17.269
What do you want?!

02:01:17.478 --> 02:01:21.815
Zero, the Hiroshima group contacted us.
They want to join forces.

02:01:22.024 --> 02:01:25.652
| see. I'll accept them,
if they intend to follow my orders.

02:01:27.112 --> 02:01:29.823
Also, that Britannian wants to see you.

02:01:30.032 --> 02:01:31.366
The TV man?

02:01:31.575 --> 02:01:33.577
Very well. He should be useful.

02:01:33.786 --> 02:01:37.414
Your name is "C.C.," right?
You should join the Knightmare Frame training--

02:01:37.623 --> 02:01:39.583
I'm in the middle of brunch.

02:01:44.922 --> 02:01:46.632
Little octopi?

02:01:46.840 --> 02:01:48.300
That girl...

02:01:48.509 --> 02:01:49.551
Um...

02:01:49.760 --> 02:01:51.220
No, these are--it's like--

02:01:51.428 --> 02:01:53.305
We have visitors.

02:01:53.514 --> 02:01:55.516
They also have an introduction from Kyoto.

02:01:58.936 --> 02:02:00.896
Are you... the Four Holy Swords?!

02:02:01.104 --> 02:02:05.317
I'll get straight to the point.
We'd like your help.

02:02:05.526 --> 02:02:06.610
How do you mean?

02:02:06.819 --> 02:02:09.112
Lieutenant Colonel Tohdoh has been captured.

02:02:09.321 --> 02:02:12.491
He sacrificed himself so that we could escape.

02:02:13.742 --> 02:02:15.577
| see. We'll help them.

02:02:15.786 --> 02:02:16.787
You sure?

02:02:16.995 --> 02:02:20.749
It's only natural, isn't it?
The Black Knights are champions of justice.

02:02:23.710 --> 02:02:25.671
We'll use rendezvous method B-13.

02:02:25.879 --> 02:02:27.840
Disassemble and bring in the
Knightmares from course 18.

02:02:28.048 --> 02:02:32.302
Have Diethard handle it.
And alert the rendezvous team members.

02:02:34.429 --> 02:02:38.433
Score! I can't believe they're
delivering Tohdoh right to me.

02:02:38.642 --> 02:02:41.061
Yes, this pond does freeze solid in the winter.

02:02:41.270 --> 02:02:44.231
Big brother yelled at me
when I skated on it, though.

02:02:44.439 --> 02:02:46.817
Huh. We had a pond at
the Kururugi shrine, too.

02:02:47.025 --> 02:02:51.196
It was little, but I'd catch zarigani--
| mean, crayfish--all the time.

02:02:51.405 --> 02:02:53.824
You can catch crayfish?

02:02:54.032 --> 02:02:57.119
It's easy. You attach a kaeru's leg to a string.

02:02:57.327 --> 02:03:00.664
Huh? "Kaeru" as in frog?
The things that go "croak, croak"?

02:03:00.873 --> 02:03:04.084
Yeah, although in Japanese
they go, "Kero-kero, kero-kero."

02:03:04.293 --> 02:03:05.711
"Kero-kero"?

02:03:05.919 --> 02:03:07.963
If things go according to plan,
a time will come

02:03:08.171 --> 02:03:09.089
